{"id":"wb-7-326","name":"芒砀山汉代礼制建筑基址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"芒砀山汉代礼制建筑基址","text":"芒砀山汉代礼制建筑基址，位于中华人民共和国河南省商丘市永城市芒砀山，2013年被列为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。\n该建筑基址位于芒砀山主峰，发现于2006年，东西长31.5米，南北宽33.5米，被汉代梁国的王陵环绕。专家考证此基址的时代与梁国早期梁孝王墓的时代一致，并由此推测此处可能为祭祀梁国先祖的祖庙，而梁王陵墓则环绕之而建。此基址的存在也解释了为何芒砀山主峰并无梁王王陵这一历史疑团。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%8A%92%E7%A0%80%E5%B1%B1%E6%B1%89%E4%BB%A3%E7%A4%BC%E5%88%B6%E5%BB%BA%E7%AD%91%E5%9F%BA%E5%9D%80","revisionId":91627452,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91627452","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/95ee8515e4e958072b39ea34.jpg","title":"20260131_Site_of_the_Han_Dynasty_Ritual_Structures_on_Mount_Mangdang_02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20260131_Site_of_the_Han_Dynasty_Ritual_Structures_on_Mount_Mangdang_02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b7/20260131_Site_of_the_Han_Dynasty_Ritual_Structures_on_Mount_Mangdang_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​永城 芒砀山汉代礼制建筑基址","width":320,"height":213}}